<title>USA: Pamida opens Indiana distribution center.</title>
<headline>Pamida opens Indiana distribution center.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pamida Holdings Corp, a mass merchandiser retailer, said it opened its new Pamida Distribution Center in Lebanon, Ind.</p>
<p>The 200,000 square foot facility currently employs 20 people for its start-up operations. By year-end personnel are expected to increase to 75.</p>
<p>The distribution center will eventually expand to 400,000 square feet and employ as many as 150.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
